            <div class="center-paragraph" id="elegen-accuracy-desc">      
             <p>Elegen reliably delivers DNA up to 7kb with more than 95% of the molecules sequence perfect. Traditional gene fragments have an error rate of 1 in 3500, meaning laborious traditional cloning is often required for your workflow. Elegen’s unique process yields superior DNA that can often be used without traditional cloning in many high-throughput workflows. When clonal DNA is required, Elegen’s DNA streamlines your workflow by simplifying assembly of longer DNA while letting you pick far fewer colonies.</p>

